            {
                "entry_id": "2ab840d9-f0a2-365c-80c8-ddc9285a38b0",
                "word": "afforestation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c3584665-455b-4d83-a48a-58c868367018",
                        "entry_id": "2ab840d9-f0a2-365c-80c8-ddc9285a38b0",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "afforestations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e9fe141d-affb-3417-b288-9e20b5e6db63",
                        "entry_id": "2ab840d9-f0a2-365c-80c8-ddc9285a38b0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Plantation d’arbres dans le but de créer des forêts de toutes pièces."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "646affda-077f-465d-9572-585a6908cb50",
                                "sense_id": "e9fe141d-affb-3417-b288-9e20b5e6db63",
                                "text": "Le choix des espèces employées pour la fixation et l’afforestation des sables est assez varié ; il diffère dans les diverses zones géographiques et selon les diverses conditions de croissance des ligneux."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b4dec8c-51d0-4a5d-a1e9-6fdbdddd3f53",
                                "sense_id": "e9fe141d-affb-3417-b288-9e20b5e6db63",
                                "text": "Dans le premier cas, cette valeur non additive peut être « piégée » par la multiplication végétative en vue de l’afforestation directe avec ces plants."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8278b64-9f0f-49a5-beac-84a4cf01fb97",
                                "sense_id": "e9fe141d-affb-3417-b288-9e20b5e6db63",
                                "text": "Sachant que j’étais juif, il avait ajouté : « Après l’indépendance, nous devrons envoyer des missions en Israël », et, comme je m’étonnais : « Oui, nous avons énormément à apprendre d’eux. — En quel domaine ? demandai-je. — Oh, les kibboutzim, l’irrigation, l’afforestation, l’amélioration des sols. »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "83f85322-e3ba-4d78-a084-edd5e7ff3827",
                                "sense_id": "e9fe141d-affb-3417-b288-9e20b5e6db63",
                                "text": "À l’origine du conflit : des arbres. Les communautés locales se mobilisent contre un plan d’afforestation mené par l’État dans le nord du Néguev, une zone semi-aride qui reçoit 250 mm de pluie par an en moyenne."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d0832903-52a5-47be-b705-7accd62a1bc1",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ab840d9-f0a2-365c-80c8-ddc9285a38b0",
                        "source_sense_id": "e9fe141d-affb-3417-b288-9e20b5e6db63",
                        "source_sense_description": "Plantation d'arbres dans le but de constituer des forêts",
                        "target_lang_word": "Aufforstung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Aufforstung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "01c95af2-22bf-3b6c-87ee-21a309cd4658",
                                        "entry_id": "db12b073-a212-3fbe-8c2e-a558e4a55bb8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anpflanzung von Bäumen in größerem Umfang, auf größerer Fläche, damit neuer Wald nachwächst"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Waldwirtschaft"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5427d606-633f-4966-ba06-f146e3bf5705",
                                                "sense_id": "01c95af2-22bf-3b6c-87ee-21a309cd4658",
                                                "text": "„Auch in Oldenburg haben die erfreulichen Ergebmisse der Aufforstung wüster Landstrecken zu immer weiterer Ausdehnung derselben angespornt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "643648f3-6ebc-44f4-ad86-27b59b72fd87",
                                                "sense_id": "01c95af2-22bf-3b6c-87ee-21a309cd4658",
                                                "text": "„Zur Aufforstung des Landes wurden in den letzten drei Jahrzehnten enorme Anstrengungen unternommen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbe7d3ab-ccb5-4efd-bb74-4d62e1e837f3",
                                                "sense_id": "01c95af2-22bf-3b6c-87ee-21a309cd4658",
                                                "text": "„Eine Hauptaufgabe der Forstverwaltung ist die Aufforstung aufgelassener Weideflächen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48a07150-10c5-4091-9b4d-0d23e6580fd6",
                                                "sense_id": "01c95af2-22bf-3b6c-87ee-21a309cd4658",
                                                "text": "„Neue Wälder liefern mehr Holz. Wer also nachhaltig wirtschaften will, sollte ein Interesse an Aufforstung haben.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95c0cecc-965d-44a5-b316-174bf0fc66cc",
                                                "sense_id": "01c95af2-22bf-3b6c-87ee-21a309cd4658",
                                                "text": "„Weltweite Aufforstungen sollen die Klimakrise abwenden – denn Milliarden neuer Bäume könnten das Treibhausgas Kohlenstoffdioxid aus der Luft filtern.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "22038b83-01b0-48f4-806a-fab5f2cad971",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ab840d9-f0a2-365c-80c8-ddc9285a38b0",
                        "source_sense_id": "e9fe141d-affb-3417-b288-9e20b5e6db63",
                        "source_sense_description": "Plantation d'arbres dans le but de constituer des forêts",
                        "target_lang_word": "afforestation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "afforestation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3bc1d2f2-9da8-3947-bce6-ce9aa84ab6e4",
                                        "entry_id": "6669f85c-fd53-3b1b-a2d2-077a1b058ceb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act or process of creating a new forest where none had existed before, or reforestation of areas long deforested."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a83ccac-8e07-4bba-b38e-818dd3d8917d",
                                                "sense_id": "3bc1d2f2-9da8-3947-bce6-ce9aa84ab6e4",
                                                "text": "Much might be said of the condition of the timber in the reserves, as typified in this locality, of possible means for its conservation and regulated use, and of the problems of afforestation, and of sylviculture generally, which are involved in the proper management of the reserves."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74177ee2-6cce-4035-94bd-fa2ffafbc2ee",
                                                "sense_id": "3bc1d2f2-9da8-3947-bce6-ce9aa84ab6e4",
                                                "text": "While, however, the military critic from Britain might concur in this, he might tell us that the afforestation of such a wilderness as is Natal, for instance, is too large an undertaking for practical consideration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02b2b7f7-514b-4f94-abf8-c8ae2e712de4",
                                                "sense_id": "3bc1d2f2-9da8-3947-bce6-ce9aa84ab6e4",
                                                "text": "At first the Japanese, too, were careless in this respect, for the supply of camphor trees seemed practically limitless, but the great increase in the demand for the product in late years has made scientific afforestation necessary."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e49f8c51-35bb-434f-8e6e-66f94bec9d9c",
                                                "sense_id": "3bc1d2f2-9da8-3947-bce6-ce9aa84ab6e4",
                                                "text": "There are very few native trees in Iceland, primarily downy birch and rowan, but afforestation efforts are underway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "24dccdb2-3f76-460e-b738-1428f23f1766",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ab840d9-f0a2-365c-80c8-ddc9285a38b0",
